## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

Each entry in `governance_groups` is populated by the same conversion code
as the singular [`identitynow_governance_group_v1` data source](../data-sources/governance_group_v1.md) -
see its "Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes" section for the full list
of limitations shared by both.

`GET /workgroups/v1`'s documented maximum `limit` is 250; requested limits
above that are capped with a warning rather than an error.
